### 3.2 Brahma

- First member of Hindu Triad; promulgator of Ayurveda.
- Composed science of life in 1,00,000 Slokas, 1000 chapters, before creating human beings.
- Abridged into eight divisions:
  1. Kaya chikitsa – General Medicine
  2. Bala Chikitsa – Pediatrics
