### 5.1 Agnivesa

- Most intelligent among six disciples of Atreya.
- Composed Agnivesa Tantra, 12,000 verses.
- Redacted by Charaka -> Charaka Samhita.
- 41 chapters lost: 17 Chikitsa, 12 Kalpa, 12 Siddhi; later redacted by Dridhabala.
