  4. Tiktaka Ghritam
  5. Mahatiktaka Ghritam
  6. Trushanadyam Ghritam
- Date: between Adharvana Veda (1500 BC) and Panini (7th BC), around 1000 BC.

### 5.2 Bhela

- One of six disciples of Atreya; contemporary of Agnivesa.
- Bhela Samhita available; concise, prose.
- Belongs to Gandhara/Kandhahar, Afghanistan.
- Also known as Bheda.
